msgstr "Mostrar un icono en la bandeja del sistema"

#: src/qml/pages/AppSettingsPage.qml:387
msgid ""
"The tray icon shows the remaining time. Click it to show or hide the window; "
"use its menu to start, pause, stop or quit."
msgstr ""
"El icono de la bandeja muestra el tiempo restante. Haz clic para mostrar u "
"ocultar la ventana; usa su menú para iniciar, pausar, detener o salir."

#: src/qml/pages/AppSettingsPage.qml:392
